{"ts": 0.040372, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m──\u001b[0m \u001b[93mshelltutor\u001b[0m \u001b[90m──\u001b[0m \u001b[90mStage 2 · Paths\u001b[0m \u001b[90m──────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m \u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[93m◉\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m \u001b[90m──\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 280}
{"ts": 0.040459, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n\u001b[1;97mStage 2: Paths\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nSix short lessons, then a task. The shell is always standing in one\r\nfolder. You'll learn to see where, look around, and move.\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Type \u001b[92mnext\u001b[93m for lesson 2.1.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 213}
