{"ts": 0.066887, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97mWhere you are\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nYou are always standing in one folder: the \u001b[1mcurrent directory\u001b[0m. Here\r\nis your practice folder, drawn as a tree:\r\n", "len": 147}
{"ts": 0.06693, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "  /var/folders/jx/f_4n055973x5cwnyh_mhlw9h0000gn/T/shelltutor-sim-home-el8g8o2v  \u001b[93m◀ you are here\u001b[0m\r\n  ├── poem.txt\r\n  ├── numbers.txt\r\n  ├── stage1/\r\n  └── stage2/\r\n\r\n  \u001b[92mpwd\u001b[0m        \u001b[90m# predict what it prints, then run it\u001b[0m\r\nThe line \u001b[92mpwd\u001b[0m prints is the full name of the \"you are here\" folder.\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Run \u001b[92mpwd\u001b[93m, then type \u001b[92mnext\u001b[93m.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 409}
